              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{16^{\\sin^{2} x}-4^{\\sin x}}{\\sqrt{\\cos x}-1}=0\"></span>. </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{3\\pi}{4};\\pi]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T16:28:05.066714+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T16:28:05.066714+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Дробь равна нулю, если ее чис­ли­тель равен нулю, а зна­ме­на­тель су­ще­ству­ет. По­это­му при усло­вии <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\le \\cos x\\lt 1\"></span> имеем:<center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"4^{2\\sin^{2} x}=4^{\\sin x}\\iff 2\\sin^{2} x=\\sin x\\iff \\sin x(2\\sin x-1)=0\\iff\"></span>  <img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"1f150ff7-24bf-4ab7-93ac-d5366c8504b1\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\sin x=0\\\\\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</p></center><p> С уче­том огра­ни­че­ния <span data-inline-latex=\"x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .  </p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Отберём корни на про­ме­жут­ке  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{3\\pi}{4};\\pi]\"></span>  с по­мо­щью три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти (см. рис.), по­лу­чим  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span> .  </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
