            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"f8a7b15b-5fc3-4167-8af4-3fa30bf1a251\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/f8a7b15b-5fc3-4167-8af4-3fa30bf1a251\"/></p><p>а)  При­ме­ним фор­му­лу при­ве­де­ния, све­дем урав­не­ние к квад­рат­но­му от­но­си­тель­но ко­си­ну­са:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"2^{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)}-2\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2\\cos^2 x}=0\\Leftrightarrow 2^{\\cos x}=2^{1-2\\cos^2 x}\\Leftrightarrow \\cos x=1-2\\cos^2 x\\Leftrightarrow 2\\cos^2 x+\\cos x-1=0\\Leftrightarrow \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x&amp;=\\frac{1}{2},\\\\\\cos x&amp;=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow \\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;=\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z},\\\\x&amp;=\\pi+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span></span></p><p></p></center><p>б)  Отберём корни при по­мо­щи три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дят <span data-inline-latex=\"3\\pi\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{11\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{13\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
